verses.raw_usfm:
The furnace tests the potter’s vessels;  
\q2 so the test of a person is in his thoughts.   
\q1

Love a friend, and keep faith with him;  
\q2 but if you reveal his secrets,  
\q2 you shall not follow him;   
\q1

for as a man has destroyed his enemy,  
\q2 so you have destroyed the friendship of your neighbor.   
\q1

One who winks the eye contrives evil things;  
\q2 and those who know him will keep their distance.   
\q1
